# Magma step observation for inc-szz3; use the pinned options fixture.
# Terrain letter observed in magma-probe seed 4, screen 0001 terrain-list:
# |  [h] Ice Wall             [y] chasm                [P] magma                 |
# Page 1: 1-51 of 63. P is uppercase.
# Place three adjacent magma squares east of the player. Dumps preserve
# each damage event, including a fatal hit if the death prompt intervenes.
# Seeds 4/5/6: entry costs 0 HP; the second move costs 26/18/23 HP.
# The third attempt reaches 0 HP before leaving square 2. Leave Die?
# unanswered to preserve the fatal-hit screen; the final messages dump
# remains that prompt, not a message-history window.
# Low-HP warnings need SPACE before another movement command can work.
@include chargen-paladin.keys
SPACE
w y
K RIGHT ENTER P
w K RIGHT*2 ENTER P
w K RIGHT*3 ENTER P
@dump:before
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@while "Low Hitpoint Warning!" SPACE
@dump:step-1
v
@dump:messages-1
ESC
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@while "Low Hitpoint Warning!" SPACE
@dump:step-2
v
@dump:messages-2
ESC
RIGHT
@while "Confirm enter" y
@while "Low Hitpoint Warning!" SPACE
@dump:step-3
v
@dump:messages
@quit
